{"id":"eaf2215780d904d4","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-proof-height.md","title":"Proof Height","display":"df-proof-height — Proof Height","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-proof-height","aliases":["72-df-proof-height"],"display":"df-proof-height — Proof Height","depends_on":["[[72-df-proof-tree]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III §3.1 print164–166/PDF176–178; local well-founded rank presentation","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_expansion":"补出良基证明秩的可数性与严格子节点下降"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-proof-height"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-proof-height</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-height — Proof Height"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III §3.1 print164–166/PDF176–178; local well-founded rank presentation"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"补出良基证明秩的可数性与严格子节点下降"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\">\\(\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\\)</span>；所有投影在这个五元对象上取值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>另要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WFChild}(D)\">\\(\\operatorname{WFChild}(D)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_\\pi\">\\(h_\\pi\\)</span> 是以下良基递归引入的序数值函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>元理论为 ZFC，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 是最小不可数序数；D 是可数地址集合。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_\\pi(u):=\\sup\\{h_\\pi(v)+1:v\\in\\operatorname{Succ}_D(u)\\},\\qquad h(\\pi):=h_\\pi(\\langle\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_\\pi(u):=\\sup\\{h_\\pi(v)+1:v\\in\\operatorname{Succ}_D(u)\\},\\qquad h(\\pi):=h_\\pi(\\langle\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_\\pi:D\\to\\omega_1,\\qquad\n\\forall u\\in D\\ \\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Succ}_D(u)\\ (h_\\pi(v)&lt;h_\\pi(u)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_\\pi:D\\to\\omega_1,\\qquad\n\\forall u\\in D\\ \\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Succ}_D(u)\\ (h_\\pi(v)&lt;h_\\pi(u)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>孩子良基关系上的递归唯一确定h，空集上确界为0。无穷证明高度可以是超限序数，不能把地址的有限长度上确界当作该秩。</p>\n<p>2026-10-13 来源定位校正：语言及ω算术规则位于第III章印刷164–166/PDF176–178；本节点的通用编码／高度递归／有限一阶扩展仍为已标明的本地构造，并非原书所有参数化规则的逐字编码。</p>\n<p>本轮扩充复核：良基归纳中每个节点只有至多可数个孩子，可数个可数序数的上确界仍可数；因此所有秩均小于 ω₁。每个孩子秩加1不超过父秩，给出严格下降。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle$ 及 $\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle$ 满足 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的 $\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)$；所有投影在这个五元对象上取值。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WFChild}(D)","display":false},{"tex":"h_\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"h_\\pi(u):=\\sup\\{h_\\pi(v)+1:v\\in\\operatorname{Succ}_D(u)\\},\\qquad h(\\pi):=h_\\pi(\\langle\\rangle).","display":true},{"tex":"h_\\pi:D\\to\\omega_1,\\qquad\n\\forall u\\in D\\ \\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Succ}_D(u)\\ (h_\\pi(v)<h_\\pi(u)).","display":true}],"bytes":1953,"backlinks":[{"id":"f9e3b3294bdd41f4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\rho$ 遍历同一演算的 $\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}$；$h(\\rho)$ 取 [[72-df-proof-height]] 的孩子秩，有限证明叶秩为0。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-248","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-proof-height|df-proof-height — Proof Height]]"},{"id":"c98701cd6a6317eb","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"对任意 $\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma}$，$h_\\rho$ 为 [[72-df-proof-height]] 的节点秩；$\\operatorname{Cuts}(\\rho)$ 与 $\\operatorname{Witness}_\\rho$ 取已有带标签证明接口。$\\operatorname{Mult}_e(\\rho):\\omega\\to\\omega$ 对所有这样的 $\\rho$ 及 $e\\in\\omega$ 定义，不要求 $\\rho$ 的根是 Cut。其在本定理中的输入再取上文满足主切、交换及秩条件的 $\\pi$ 与 $e=d$。$\\delta_n$ 是在 $n$ 处值1、其余自然数处值0的函数。"},{"id":"6fa80b05609c7b74","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma$，$n\\in\\omega$；$h(\\pi)$ 取 [[72-df-proof-height]]，叶节点高度为0。"}],"outgoing":["81c9c855e009a6d4"]}